WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.745 --> 00:00:03.753
- Hey man, how's it going?

00:00:03.753 --> 00:00:04.867
- Good, how's it going with you?

00:00:04.867 --> 00:00:07.784
- Ah good, how's it going with you?

00:00:11.283 --> 00:00:12.564
Oh my gosh.

00:00:12.564 --> 00:00:14.271
What the hell was that Zack?

00:00:14.271 --> 00:00:16.207
You asked him how's it
going, he said good.

00:00:16.207 --> 00:00:18.179
He asked you how's it
going, you said good,

00:00:18.179 --> 00:00:19.733
then you said how's it going again.

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:20.919
You asked him twice, dude.

00:00:20.919 --> 00:00:22.414
Do you even think before you talk?

00:00:22.414 --> 00:00:24.248
Now he totally knows that
you weren't listening

00:00:24.248 --> 00:00:26.733
the whole time, and you were
just going through the motions.

00:00:26.733 --> 00:00:28.047
Look Zack I know it's a Wednesday,

00:00:28.047 --> 00:00:29.327
we all go through the motions,

00:00:29.327 --> 00:00:31.313
but get your act together man.

00:00:31.313 --> 00:00:32.259
Hopefully he didn't notice,

00:00:32.259 --> 00:00:33.899
but guess what everybody in the world

00:00:33.899 --> 00:00:36.172
probably noticed how dumb you are Zack.

00:00:36.172 --> 00:00:38.439
Honestly I'm embarrassed to
be your conscience right now.

00:00:38.439 --> 00:00:39.502
You suck.

00:00:39.502 --> 00:00:42.750
You should just quit
your job Zack, move away.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:44.848
You don't deserve friends,
you don't deserve family,

00:00:44.848 --> 00:00:46.751
you don't deserve girls.

00:00:46.751 --> 00:00:48.250
Just get out of here.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:49.444
What are you doing?

00:00:49.444 --> 00:00:50.861
You're worthless.

00:00:53.404 --> 00:00:55.010
- I'm good man.

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:55.927
- Oh, good.

00:00:57.435 --> 00:00:59.239
- Oh, happy belated birthday by the way.

00:00:59.239 --> 00:01:00.274
- Ah you too man.

00:01:00.274 --> 00:01:03.107
(dramatic music)

